subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

List all subscriptions

USAGE:
  subtrack list <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                         Display this help message
  -v, --version                      Display this version
  -c, --currency <currency>          Convert all prices to target currency
  --sort <sort>                      Sort field: name, price, currency, cycle
  -d, --desc                         Sort descending
  -a, --api                          Include LLM API usage for current month
  -n, --notes                        Show notes column
  -m, --method                       Show payment method column
  --contract                         Show contract dates column
  --vendor                           Show vendor column
  --status <status>                  Filter by status: active, paused, cancelled, archived
  --min-price <min-price>            Filter by minimum price
  --max-price <max-price>            Filter by maximum price
  -j, --json                         Output as JSON
  --tags <tags>                      Comma-separated tag names to filter by (AND logic)
  --limit <limit>                    Max number of items to show
  --offset <offset>                  Number of items to skip
  --include-archived                 Include archived subscriptions

